OL,3,GNEWSAMoment rescued fox cubs are
OL,4,Areleased back into wild
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree fox cubs have been released back
OL,7,Finto the wild more than four months
OL,8,Fafter they became trapped in a small
OL,9,Fgap between two houses.
OL,11,FFirefighters had to remove brickwork
OL,12,Ffrom the garage of one house in
OL,13,FLeicester to rescue the cubs on Easter
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FCrews were called to Letchworth Road
OL,17,Fafter residents heard the distressed
OL,18,Fcries of a fox, but when a hole was
OL,19,Fmade in the wall, the three cubs were
OL,20,Ffound stuck behind the brickwork.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
