OL,3,GNEWSAMoment rescued fox cubs are
OL,4,Areleased back into wild
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cubs have been cared for by charity
OL,7,FLeicestershire Wildlife Hospital, based
OL,8,Fin Kibworth Beauchamp near Market
OL,9,FHarborough, and were set free together
OL,10,Fat an undisclosed location.
